          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Natani akumjamuka Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AMBUJE",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵamtumile jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Natani kwa Daudi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Natani ali ayice kwa Daudi, ŵamsalile citagu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " cakuti, “Mu msinda wine mwapali ŵandu ŵaŵili, jwine jwaliji jwakusicila, jwine jwakulaga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mas 51 (Mtwe)",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwakusicilajo jwakwete ngondolo syejinji ni ng'ombe soni syejinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwakulaga jula nginakola kandu kane kalikose nambo ka ngondolo kamkolope, kele kiŵasumile jwalakwejo. Ŵakalanjile ka ngondoloko cenene, mpaka kakusile kali ni jwalakwejo pamo ni ŵanace ŵakwe. Mkalyaga nawo cakulya ca mundujo, mpaka soni kamwelaga mgawo ŵakwe. Soni ŵagonaga ali akapakete pa makongolo gakwe. Kaliji mpela mwanace jwakwe jwamkongwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lisiku line ku nyumba ja mundu jwakusicila jula kwayice mlendo. Mundu jwakusicila jula nginasaka kujigala jimo mwa ngondolo syakwe, kapena jimo mwa ng'ombe syakwe, kuti amwulajile mlendo jwakwejo. M'malo mwakwe ŵagambile kujigala ngondolo ja mundu jwa kulaga jula, kumwulajila mlendo juŵayice kukunguluka jula.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali apikene ngani ja mundu jwakusicilajo, Daudi ŵapile mtima mnope. Ni ŵamsalile Natani kuti, “Ngulumbila pa lina lya AMBUJE ŵajumi kuti, mundu juŵatesile yindu yeleyiju, akwenela kuwulajidwa basi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Soni pa mwanace jwangondolojo awucisye ŵanace ŵane ŵangondolo mcece, ligongo lyakutenda yindu ya mtundu welewo, ni soni pakuŵa ŵaliji mundu jwangali canasa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Natani ŵamsalile Daudi kuti, “Mundujo, ni wawojo. AMBUJE, Mlungu wa Aisalaeli, akusala kuti, ‘Une nam'wecice ucimwene kuti mŵe mwenye jwa Aisalaeli, soni namkulupwisye m'magasa ga Saulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nampele liŵasa lyosope lya ambuje ŵenu, kwisa soni aciŵamkwawo ambuje ŵenuwo kuti aŵe m'magasa mwenu, soni nampele mtundu wa Aisalaeli pamo ni lukosyo lwa Yuda. Yikaŵe kuti yeleyi yamnondipile, ngamjonjecesye yine soni yejinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ana ligongo cici mganyosisye maloŵe ga AMBUJE, ni kutenda cindu cakusakala pameso pawo? Mumwuleje Uliya Muhiti ni upanga, ni mwalombile ŵamkwakwe. Mumwulajisye Uliyajo kupitila mwa Aamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni ligongo lyakwe sambano ngondo ngasijityoka peŵasa penu, ligongo munyosisye une, soni mlombele ŵamkwawo Uliya Muhiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo une AMBUJE ngusala kuti, tinamgwicisye m'mwejo yisawusyo mwiŵasa mwenumo. Tinamtyocesye aciŵamkwenu, m'mwejo mli mkulola, ni tinjapeleka kwa jwamlume jwine, ni tacigona nawo aciŵamkwenuwo musi napula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 16:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'mwejo mtesile yeleyi mwakusisa, nambo une tinjiyitenda pameso pa Aisalaeli wosope, musi napula.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo Daudi ŵamsalile Natani kuti, “Nalemwecesye AMBUJE.” Natani ŵatite kuti, “AMBUJE ŵakululucile ŵalakwe ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wawo, ngawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo, pakuŵa ŵatesile yindu yeleyi ŵalakwe, ni kuti ŵanyosisye AMBUJE mnope, mwanace jutacimŵelecelajo taciwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali amasile kuŵeceta, Natani ŵawujile ku nyumba jakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuwa kwa mwanace jwa Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo AMBUJE ŵapelece cilango kwa mwanace juŵaŵelecele Daudi kwa ŵamkwawo Uliya, ni ŵalwasile mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵampopelele mwanacejo kwa Mlungu. Ŵalesile kulya, ni ŵajinjile m'nyumba, ni ŵagonile pasi cilo cosope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acakulungwakulungwa ŵa ku nyumba jakwe ja ucimwene, ŵajimi pa mbali pakwe kuti amjimusye. Nambo jwalakwe ŵakanile kwimuka, soni nginalya nawo cakulya ŵanduwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uli upite mlungu umope, mwanace jula ŵawile. Ŵakutumicila ŵa Daudi ŵajogwepe kuja kumsalila kuti mwanace jula awile. Ŵatite kuti, “Ndaŵi jiŵaliji mwanacejo ciŵela umi, Daudi nginatujangaga ndaŵi jituŵeceteneje najo. Ana sambano tukamsalile uli kuti mwanacejo awile? Mwine ni kukomboleka kulipweteka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Daudi piŵaweni kuti ŵakutumicila ŵakwe ŵaliji mkusongona kwa jwine ni mjakwe, ŵamanyilile kuti mwanace jula awile. Myoyo ŵawusisye ŵakutumicila ŵakwe ŵala kuti, “Ana mwanace jula atulesile?” Ŵakutumicila ŵala ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo, atulesile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo Daudi ŵajimwice pasi piŵagonile pala. Ŵajawile kuja koga, ŵapakele mawuta, ni ŵawete yakuwala yine. Kaneko ŵapite kuja kumlambila m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. Panyuma pakwe ŵapite ku nyumba jakwe, ni ŵaŵilasisye cakulya. Ŵandu piŵayice naco cakulyaco, jwalakwe ŵalile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakutumicila ŵakwe ŵala ŵamwusisye kuti, “Ŵalakwe ambuje atusalile cenene, ana yindu yatesileyi yili ya mtunduci? Ndaŵi jiŵaliji mwanace jula cijumi, ŵalakwe akanileje kulya. Nambo ndaŵi jawile, ŵalakwe ŵajimwice, ni kutanda kulya.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵajanjile kuti, “Ndaŵi jiŵaliji cijumi mwanacejo, naliji mkana yakulya soni naliji mkulila, pakuŵa naliji mganisya kuti, ‘Mwine AMBUJE takombolece kundendela canasa, kuti mwanacejo aŵe ni umi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo sambano mwanacejo awile. Nambi tinayikanile soni cici yakulya? Ana mpaka nipakombole kumwusya soni? Une lisiku line tinjijawula kwali jwalakwejo, nambo jwalakwejo ngisawujila soni kwa une.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kupagwa kwa Solomoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
