            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵawutamice pasi mtima wa Betisheba ŵamkwakwe, nipo Daudi ŵatemi najo jwamkongwejo. Nipo kaneko jwamkongwe jula ŵaŵelece mwanace jwamlume, nipo Daudi ŵampele lina lyakuti Solomoni. AMBUJE ŵamnonyele mwanacejo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŵatumisye maloŵe kupitila mwa jwakulocesya Natani kuti mwanacejo lina lyakwe liŵe Yedidiya, ligongo AMBUJE ŵamnonyele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi akuwusumula msinda wa Laba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndaŵi jeleji Yowabu ni asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵa Aisalaeli ŵaliji mkuputa ngondo ku Laba, msinda wekulungwa wa Aamoni, ni ŵasigele panandi kuwusumula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatumile ŵandu ni utenga kwa Daudi wakusala kuti, “Mbutile ngondo mu msinda wa Laba, ni sumwile malo kugakuwuma mesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sambano ŵalakwe ŵasongenye asilikali ŵa ngondo ŵosope ŵiŵasigele, ni ŵalakwe ayice akuno kuti tataŵe masakasa kuwusyungulila msindawo ni kuwusumula, kogopela kuti naga une ngusumula wele msindawo, tucikolanjidwa ni lina lyangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵasongenye asilikali ŵakwe wosope ŵa ngondo, ni ŵajile ku Laba kuputa ngondo ni ŵawusumwile msindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Daudi ŵacityosisye cisoti kumtwe kwa Milikomu, mlungu jwagumba jwa Aamoni. Cisotico casitopaga makilogalamu ga golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " 35, pacisotipo gapali maganga ga mtengo wapenani. Daudi ŵagatyosisye maganga ga mtengo wapenani gala, ni ŵagaŵisile pa cisoti cakwe. Ŵajigele soni yindu yejinji ya mu msindawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakopwesye ŵandu ŵa mu msindawo kuja kukwakamulisya masengo, masowo, mapiki, maŵago ni kwagumbisya njelwa. Ŵatesile yalumope ni misinda josope ja Aamoni. Kaneko Daudi ni asilikali ŵakwe ŵa ngondo ŵawujile ku Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
